e.com/article/price-of-oil-08-20-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-20.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-20-2026/</guid></item><item><title>到 2050 年代，气候变化将使伦敦每年损失高达 360 亿英镑</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/climate-change-cost-london-up-to-36-billion-a-year-2050s/</link><description>气候变暖的极端天气造成的工作时间损失、企业中断和基础设施损坏可能会在未来几十年减少首都的 GDP。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2282584831-e1787223279425.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:57:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/climate-change-cost-london-up-to-36-billion-a-year-2050s/</guid></item><item><title>Zynga 创始人 Mark Pincus：人工智能可以让你达到 B+，但不会让你达到 A</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/zynga-founder-mark-pincus-why-ai-wont-save-you/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2260125364-e1787214066471.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:32:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/zynga-founder-mark-pincus-why-ai-wont-save-you/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能无法修复一家破产的公司。重新接线就会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/tiaa-accenture-rewire-broken-country-ai-adoption/</link><description>想象一下，有一条铁路斥资数十亿美元建造了世界上最快的火车，然后在同样老化的铁轨上运行它们。轨道是约束。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/sastry-manish.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/tiaa-accenture-rewire-broken-country-ai-adoption/</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊无法放弃贝佐斯的无人机梦想</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/amazon-cant-quit-bezos-drone-dream/</link><description>今天的版本：亚马逊无人机、Stripe OpenRouter、Google Marvell 交易、Meta审判、OpenAI IPO、SpaceX Cognition、YouTube 与 Netflix、Rivian 衍生品&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281425980-e1787187249120.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 08:58:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/amazon-cant-quit-bezos-drone-dream/</guid></item><item><title>委内瑞拉石油部长对美国公司表示：“这是一个等待被发现的世界”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/venezuela-oil-minister-us-entire-world-waiting-discovered-08-20-2026/</link><description>随着破旧的能源行业的发展，美国规模较小的私营石油生产商开始在委内瑞拉签署交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2270757547-e1787176466286.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/venezuela-oil-minister-us-entire-world-waiting-discovered-08-20-2026/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 面临 1.4 万亿美元的威胁，这可能意味着“交出钥匙并走开”，但此案的利害关系涉及整个科技领域</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/meta-faces-1-4-trillion-threat-stakes-of-case-reach-across-tech-08-20-2026/</link><description>1.4 万亿美元的数字可能不太可能实现，但此案可能为各州提供一种新的方式来挑战社交媒体平台的设计方式。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290486931-e1787169665976.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 07:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/meta-faces-1-4-trillion-threat-stakes-of-case-reach-across-tech-08-20-2026/</guid></item></channel></rss>